ning towards the  idea of having the flash just be its own  maybe anthology series or something like  that kind of a series of movies on its  own that's tied in but not necessarily i  don't know let me know what you guys  think again none of this is like a  definitive plan i'm creating i'm not  really saying like this is what the dc  cinematic universe needs to do i just  think it's a cool idea i think it's a  cool way to basically rework their  landscape and if they really want to  stay hot on the heels or even surpass  the mcu i think this is a great way to  do it with that being said we're going  to bring this to an end thank you guys  for watching and i will catch you all  later  peace
 

